{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/learnjapanesegif.gif?t=1743041353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>POLYGLOCK</strong> provides an exciting new way of learning <strong>Japanese</strong> by combining flash-card style prompts with FPS aiming mechanics. Experience incredible progress and highly durable recall by using both motor and cognitive pathways in your gameplay.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/POLYGLOCKGeneralGameplay.gif?t=1743041353\" />Perfect for total beginners to advanced players. You can learn at your own pace with helpful hints that come complete with professional Japanese voiceovers. For the daring, there are modes to remove English and Furigana guides to truly test your Kanji skills. <br><br>You can choose from as little or as much material to learn from as you like. From the base vowels (\u3042/a,\u00a0\u3044/i,\u00a0\u3046/u,\u00a0\u3048/e,\u00a0\u304a/o) all the way to 1500+ vocabulary with advanced Kanji.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/polyglockmaterialgif.gif?t=1743041353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flex both your knowledge and aiming skills by chasing highscores that show off how many correct answers you entered within the time limit. Each unique combination of learning material selected for the run will have it's own highscore. You can also test and refine your mouse sensitivity easily with a cm/360 calculator in the options.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/POLYGLOCKHighscore2.gif?t=1743041353\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522530?t=1743041353","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com